WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:19.199
The buddies were mad.

2
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.180
"I don't like that T. rex," Sid said.

3
00:00:23.181 --> 00:00:26.124
"He's mean!"

4
00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.738
Sara nodded.

5
00:00:27.739 --> 00:00:30.458
"Let's teach him a lesson.

6
00:00:30.459 --> 00:00:33.887
We can scare him away."

7
00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:38.128
"Yeah," Rex said.

8
00:00:38.129 --> 00:00:44.503
"But how can we scare him?"

9
00:00:44.504 --> 00:00:47.009
Tor dug through her bag.

10
00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.008
She pulled out a bell.

11
00:00:49.009 --> 00:00:55.742
Ding!

12
00:00:55.743 --> 00:00:58.050
Sara shook her head.

13
00:00:58.051 --> 00:01:04.254
"That's not scary, Tor," she said.

14
00:01:04.255 --> 00:01:09.652
"I can use my tail!" Sid said.

15
00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:13.451
Sid swung his tail.

16
00:01:13.452 --> 00:01:19.741
He hit a small tree.

17
00:01:19.742 --> 00:01:23.120
"Okay, Sid," Tor said.

18
00:01:23.121 --> 00:01:25.930
"Go scare the T. rex!"

19
00:01:25.938 --> 00:01:28.057
"Um . . ."

20
00:01:28.058 --> 00:01:31.291
Sid looked at his tail.

21
00:01:31.292 --> 00:01:38.438
"What if the T. rex bites it?"

22
00:01:38.439 --> 00:01:40.775
"Rex!" Sara said.

23
00:01:40.776 --> 00:01:44.291
"You're a T. rex!

24
00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:49.785
You can scare the bully!"

25
00:01:49.786 --> 00:01:51.998
Rex frowned.

26
00:01:51.999 --> 00:01:54.923
"The bully is much bigger.

27
00:01:54.924 --> 00:01:57.981
I can't scare him."

28
00:01:57.982 --> 00:02:00.904
Sara sighed.

29
00:02:00.905 --> 00:02:03.964
"I can't scare the bully either.

30
00:02:03.965 --> 00:02:09.064
What will we do?"

